{"seq":22,"slug":"capacity-planning-autoscaling","title":"容量规划与自动伸缩","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"容量规划与自动伸缩\">容量规划与自动伸缩</h1><p>系统在流量洪峰下崩溃，或常态跑着大量闲置资源，是两种同样昂贵的失败。<strong>容量规划与自动伸缩</strong>正是解决这两个问题的工程纪律：用量化模型预判容量需求，用弹性机制让资源随负载自动增减。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-定位\">本 Hub 定位</h2><p>本 Hub 覆盖<strong>容量规划的理论基础与自动伸缩的工程实践</strong>，从排队论建模、需求预测、成本权衡，到 Kubernetes HPA/VPA、云厂商 ASG、Serverless 并发控制，再到负载测试验证与 Rightsizing 优化的完整知识链。</p>\n<p>与相邻 Hub 的边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>与本 Hub 的分界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可扩展性工程（scalability-engineering）</td>\n<td>系统架构层面的水平/垂直可扩展性设计</td>\n<td>本 Hub 聚焦<strong>运营期</strong>的容量量化与弹性机制；可扩展性工程 Hub 覆盖<strong>设计期</strong>的架构模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FinOps 云成本优化（finops-cloud-cost-optimization）</td>\n<td>账单分析、预留实例策略、成本分摊</td>\n<td>本 Hub 在容量决策中考虑成本权衡；成本优化的细节财务模型在 FinOps Hub</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kubernetes 编排（kubernetes-orchestration）</td>\n<td>Pod 调度、控制器、网络、存储</td>\n<td>本 Hub 讲 HPA/VPA 的伸缩逻辑；Kubernetes 编排 Hub 讲集群级调度与资源管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Serverless 架构（serverless-architecture）</td>\n<td>FaaS 函数编写、事件驱动、冷启动优化</td>\n<td>本 Hub 讲 Serverless 的<strong>弹性行为与并发配置</strong>；Serverless 架构 Hub 讲函数开发与事件集成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"内容地图\">内容地图</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"容量规划与自动伸缩&#10;│&#10;├── 第一章：理论基础&#10;│   ├── 容量建模方法          ← 排队论 M/M/c、Little&#39;s Law、USL&#10;│   ├── 需求预测              ← 时间序列、季节性、事件驱动峰值&#10;│   └── 成本性能权衡          ← RI/Savings Plans/Spot 组合策略&#10;│&#10;├── 第二章：自动伸缩机制&#10;│   ├── 水平与垂直伸缩        ← 无状态/有状态分片、原地扩容&#10;│   ├── 指标驱动伸缩          ← CPU/内存/QPS/延迟/自定义指标&#10;│   └── 预测式伸缩            ← 时序模型、AWS Predictive Scaling&#10;│&#10;├── 第三章：平台实现&#10;│   ├── Kubernetes HPA 与 VPA ← metrics-server、KEDA、推荐模式&#10;│   ├── 云厂商弹性服务        ← AWS ASG、GCP MIG、Azure VMSS&#10;│   └── Serverless 弹性       ← Lambda 并发、Knative、并发限制&#10;│&#10;└── 第四章：运营实践&#10;    ├── 负载测试与容量验证    ← 找极限、设 headroom、压测工具&#10;    ├── 资源适配优化          ← Usage Profiling、Goldilocks、推荐引擎&#10;    └── 容量规划流程          ← 年度规划、大促预案、红线告警\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>容量规划与自动伸缩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 第一章：理论基础</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── 容量建模方法          ← 排队论 M/M/c、Little's Law、USL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── 需求预测              ← 时间序列、季节性、事件驱动峰值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── 成本性能权衡          ← RI/Savings Plans/Spot 组合策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 第二章：自动伸缩机制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── 水平与垂直伸缩        ← 无状态/有状态分片、原地扩容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── 指标驱动伸缩          ← CPU/内存/QPS/延迟/自定义指标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── 预测式伸缩            ← 时序模型、AWS Predictive Scaling</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 第三章：平台实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── Kubernetes HPA 与 VPA ← metrics-server、KEDA、推荐模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── 云厂商弹性服务        ← AWS ASG、GCP MIG、Azure VMSS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── Serverless 弹性       ← Lambda 并发、Knative、并发限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── 第四章：运营实践</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── 负载测试与容量验证    ← 找极限、设 headroom、压测工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── 资源适配优化          ← Usage Profiling、Goldilocks、推荐引擎</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── 容量规划流程          ← 年度规划、大促预案、红线告警</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"学习路径建议\">学习路径建议</h2><p><strong>基础优先</strong>：从第一章容量建模开始，理解 Little&#39;s Law 和 USL 模型，再学需求预测与成本权衡，为后续伸缩策略选择打好理论底座。</p>\n<p><strong>工程实践</strong>：第二章和第三章可以并行学习——第二章建立伸缩机制的通用认知，第三章对应具体平台的实现细节。</p>\n<p><strong>进阶运营</strong>：第四章的负载测试、Rightsizing 和规划流程是将前三章知识落地的关键，建议结合实际项目练习。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"第一章：理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capacity-modeling","title":"容量建模方法：排队论、Little's Law 与 USL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/fundamentals/capacity-modeling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"demand-forecasting","title":"需求预测：时间序列、季节性与事件驱动峰值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/fundamentals/demand-forecasting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-performance-tradeoffs","title":"成本性能权衡：RI、Savings Plans 与 Spot 组合策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/fundamentals/cost-performance-tradeoffs"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"autoscaling","title":"第二章：自动伸缩机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/autoscaling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"horizontal-vertical-scaling","title":"水平与垂直伸缩：选择维度与有状态服务扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/autoscaling/horizontal-vertical-scaling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"metrics-driven-scaling","title":"指标驱动伸缩：选择正确的伸缩信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/autoscaling/metrics-driven-scaling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"predictive-scaling","title":"预测式伸缩：提前扩容，消除响应滞后","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/autoscaling/predictive-scaling"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"platforms","title":"第三章：平台实现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kubernetes-hpa-vpa","title":"Kubernetes HPA 与 VPA：水平与垂直弹性的平台实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/platforms/kubernetes-hpa-vpa"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cloud-provider-autoscaling","title":"云厂商弹性服务：AWS ASG、GCP MIG 与 Azure VMSS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/platforms/cloud-provider-autoscaling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"serverless-scaling","title":"Serverless 弹性：Lambda 并发、Knative 与并发限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/platforms/serverless-scaling"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"第四章：运营实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"load-testing-capacity","title":"负载测试与容量验证：找极限、设 Headroom","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/operations/load-testing-capacity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rightsizing-optimization","title":"资源适配优化：Rightsizing 与使用率剖析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/operations/rightsizing-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"capacity-planning-process","title":"容量规划流程：年度规划、大促预案与红线告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/operations/capacity-planning-process"}]}]}